{
  "schema_version": "cacg.v0.eval1",
  "description": "Retrieval-quality eval cases for `cargo xtask retrieval-eval`. Each case runs its query through the in-memory cacg-search BM25 backend and asserts every expected_card_id lands within the top-k. The gate checks card-id membership, not scores, so a float score-presentation change cannot mask a rank regression. The corpus is the real Damodaran-sourced CFA first-bite corpus (synthetic=false).",
